@startuml SD-XXX
' ============================================================
' Sequence Diagram: PREFIX-SD-XXX
' Traceability: PREFIX-REQ-XXX | PREFIX-UC-XXX | PREFIX-RB-XXX
' UC Title: <Use Case Title>
'
' One group per UC step. Each message label becomes a method on
' a class in the class model (PREFIX-CLS-*).
'
' Lifeline types:
'   actor    -- human or external system actor
'   boundary -- named screen / page / API surface / CLI entry point
'   control  -- controller / service / handler (domain logic)
'   entity   -- domain entity (from domain model)
'
' Lifeline naming conventions:
'   - Use concrete names from the UC (never generic "User")
'   - Multi-line labels via \n are supported:
'       boundary "ReviewPage\nViews/Reviews/Write.cshtml" as ReviewPage
'   - UI dependency stereotype (page reused from another UC):
'       boundary "NotFoundPage\nViews/Shared/NotFound.cshtml" as NFPage <<from_PREFIX-UC-XXX>>
'
' Arrow types:
'   ->   synchronous call
'   -->  return / response
'   ..>  async / downstream handoff (use for queue / event handoffs)
'
' Group label format: "Step N - [UC step description]"
' Alternate courses: append #Pink to the group header line
' ============================================================

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #444444

' ── Lifelines ──

actor    "ActorName"           as Actor
boundary "BoundaryName"        as Bnd
control  "ControllerName"      as Ctrl
entity   "EntityName"          as Ent

' Additional lifelines (uncomment and rename as needed):
' boundary "OtherPage"         as Bnd2
' control  "OtherService"      as Svc2
' entity   "OtherEntity"       as Ent2
' actor    "DownstreamConsumer" as Consumer

' ── Basic course ──

group Step 1 - [UC step 1 description]
  Actor  -> Bnd  : action
  Bnd    -> Ctrl : method()
  Ctrl   -> Ent  : operation()
  Ent   --> Ctrl : result
  Ctrl  --> Bnd  : response
  Bnd   --> Actor : 200 OK
end

group Step 2 - [UC step 2 description]
  Actor  -> Bnd  : next action
  Bnd    -> Ctrl : method()
  Ctrl   -> Ent  : operation()
  Ent   --> Ctrl : result
  Ctrl  --> Bnd  : response
  Bnd   --> Actor : 200 OK
end

' ── Alternate course (repeat block for each alternate course) ──

group Alternate A - [description, e.g. validation fails] #Pink
  Actor  -> Bnd  : action
  Bnd    -> Ctrl : method()
  Ctrl  --> Bnd  : error
  Bnd   --> Actor : 4xx / error page
end

' ── Invoked UC pattern (delete if not applicable) ──
' When this UC redirects into another UC, use a synthetic boundary lifeline:
' boundary "LoginRedirect\n(cookie auth challenge)" as LoginRedir
' group Alternate B - [not authenticated] #Pink
'   Ctrl --> LoginRedir : Challenge() - 302
'   LoginRedir --> Actor : redirect
'   note right of Ctrl
'     On successful login the flow re-enters Step 1.
'     (Invoked UC: PREFIX-UC-XXX Login)
'   end note
' end

' ── UI dependency pattern (delete if not applicable) ──
' boundary "NotFoundPage\nViews/Shared/NotFound.cshtml" as NFPage <<from_PREFIX-UC-XXX>>
' group Alternate C - [resource not found] #Pink
'   Ctrl  --> NFPage : View("NotFound") - 404
'   NFPage --> Actor : 404
' end

' ── Downstream / async handoff (delete if not applicable) ──
' actor "DownstreamConsumer" as Consumer
' group Step N - [save and publish]
'   Ctrl -> Ent    : save()
'   Ent  ..> Consumer : downstream - read by PREFIX-UC-XXX
' end

' ── Traceability ──
' PREFIX-REQ-XXX -> PREFIX-UC-XXX -> PREFIX-RB-XXX -> PREFIX-SD-XXX (this) -> PREFIX-CLS-* -> PREFIX-TC-*
'
' Class model derived from this diagram (PREFIX-CLS-*):
'   PREFIX-CLS-ControllerName   method(), otherMethod()
'   PREFIX-CLS-EntityName       operation() : ResultType
'
' Code skeleton paths (per docs/architecture/package-map.md):
'   src/<BoundaryPackage>/ControllerName.cs
'   src/<DomainPackage>/EntityName.cs

@enduml
